'''Cookiecane''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It resembles a marauder cutlass sword with a Christmas appearance to it. Its blade is made out of a brown cookie with white, red, and green sprinkles and white frosting as the edge. The spine of the blade is constructed out of a red and white candy cane. The guard is golden with curved quillons, and like the spine, the handle is made out of a wavy red and white candy cane with a red and white peppermint pommel, attached using a golden prong.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Cookiecane]], which was found in the same box.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun under the name [[Gingermint]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Cookie Set|Cookie Set]].

